[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4450999589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119459#issuecomment-4450999589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119459","id":4450999589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCUzdJQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T13:18:39Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T13:18:39Z","body":"I don't see that there's any corruption of `id_text`\n\nHowever if you look at the keys the keys are actually \"k1\" and \",k2\"\n\nThis is unexpected but how these files are parsed I'd say, the same would happen if you did:\n```\n[LANGUAGES]\nk1 = \"Português\" a\nk2 = \"English\",\n```\nIt'd result in the keys `k1` and `ak2`\n\nI'm not sure exactly how to solve this, it might be safe to error on trailing content and not support multiple entries per line, but that might be risky as well, so would need to be evaluated","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4450999589/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4451057252","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119459#issuecomment-4451057252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119459","id":4451057252,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCU2-ZA","user":{"login":"estenio12","id":7588241,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODgyNDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7588241?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/estenio12","html_url":"https://github.com/estenio12","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/estenio12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/estenio12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/estenio12/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/estenio12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/estenio12/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/estenio12/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/estenio12/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/estenio12/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/estenio12/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T13:26:40Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T13:26:40Z","body":"Thanks for the analysis! The fact that trailing characters leak into the next key (transforming k2 into ,k2) confirms the problem of an unstable parser state.\n\nWhile ConfigFile is flexible, it's hard to justify a use case where trailing content after a closed Variant (like a string) should be silently accepted and prepended to the next entry. This creates an 'invisible' corruption that is extremely hard to debug because the source of the error (line 10) is different from the symptoms (line 11).\n\nSuggestion: Perhaps ConfigFile could implement a stricter check: if the parser finishes a Variant and find anything other than a newline or a comment start (; or #), it should return ERR_PARSE_ERROR. This follows the 'Fail-Fast' principle and prevents this kind of 'ghost' key corruption.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4451057252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6200489892","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119459#issuecomment-6200489892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119459","id":6200489892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcZP3pA","user":{"login":"tciviero","id":179772110,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrcazg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179772110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero","html_url":"https://github.com/tciviero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-15T19:26:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T19:27:52Z","body":"`ConfigFile::_parse` calls `VariantParser::parse_tag_assign_eof`, so it is the same issue as #122824 for which i already made a pull request (#122870), this issue should then be linked to that pr.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6200489892/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]